dsh-plugin-antigravity
======================

Unofficial client. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Google LLC or
DeepSeek. Antigravity, Gemini and Google are trademarks of Google LLC; Claude is a
trademark of Anthropic.

The plugin reuses the operator's own Antigravity session on the operator's own machine:
no credentials are bundled, proxied to third parties, or transmitted anywhere except to
Google's own API endpoints. It speaks a private, undocumented API that may change at any
time, and it consumes the operator's Antigravity quota/plan limits. Use it only with an
account you are allowed to use this way.

This repository contains no access tokens, refresh tokens or client secrets. The OAuth
client id/secret used for the token exchange are discovered at runtime from the locally
installed Antigravity binary; `docs/api.md` masks the secret.

Third-party components: none. The plugin has no runtime dependencies outside the Node.js
standard library (>= 20).
